---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Advisory for Large-Scale Mining Companies"
  description="Helping large-scale mining companies manage the interface with artisanal and small-scale mining responsibly."
>
  <section class="section service-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/what-we-do">&larr; What We Do</a></p>
      <h1 class="reveal">03 &middot; Advisory for Large-Scale Mining Companies</h1>
      <p class="lede reveal">
        Large-scale concessions in Sub-Saharan Africa rarely sit in
        isolation from artisanal mining. We help LSM operators manage that
        interface as a relationship worth managing carefully.
      </p>

      <div class="body-grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>What this covers</h2>
          <p>
            Mapping artisanal mining activity in and around a concession,
            assessing the safety, legal and reputational exposure it
            creates, and designing coexistence or formalisation pathways
            that reduce conflict at its source.
          </p>
          <p>
            Community relations work where an LSM operation and ASM
            livelihoods overlap, and incident response support when that
            relationship has already broken down and needs to be rebuilt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>How we work</h2>
          <p>
            We operate our own ASM site, which gives us credibility on both
            sides of this relationship: artisanal miners recognise us as
            fellow practitioners, and LSM operators get advice grounded in
            how an ASM operation actually functions day
            to day.
          </p>
          <p>
            Recommendations are built around what a concession can
            realistically implement and sustain, given its existing
            security, community relations and compliance structures.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="pill-btn" href="/contact">Talk to us about your concession</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .body-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--gap);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .cta-row {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .body-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
